# Backend Python

- FastAPI app: `backend/app/main.py`
- Routers em `backend/app/routers/`
- Models SQLAlchemy: `backend/app/models.py`
- SQLite dev: `backend/data/rpg_op.db`
- Uploads: `backend/data/uploads/`

## Padrões

- Pydantic v2: `model_validate(obj, from_attributes=True)` para ORM
- Multipart para upload de template image
- Validar fichas contra schema JSON da campanha

## Teste

```powershell
backend/.venv/Scripts/python backend/scripts/smoke_test.py
```
